  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "視覺與家具設計",
    "sub_ename": "VISUALIZATION AND FURNITURE DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "現代設計史中，視覺與家具佔有舉足輕重之地位，以丹麥手工椅為例，利用蒸氣彎製技術來製成一張經典椅，在不同時代分野中，經典家具各自佔有一席地位。本次課程邀請同學深入探討美張經典座椅背後之故事與時代背景，包括當時製成之技術與材料應用。利用個案研究之經典座椅，放置住家空間中，並以視覺模型來了解置入後之空間狀態。在結構體不改變情況下，調整居家室內空間之傢俱與傢飾擺設與配色計畫，進而達到一完全合諧狀態（Harmony）。",
    "describe_eh": "Modern design history, the furniture occupies a pivotal position to Danish hand chair, for example, the use of steam bending technology to make a classic chair, in different times, the classic furniture each occupies a seat status.  This course invites students to explore the story behind the US classic seat and the background of the times, including the technology and materials used at that time. Without changing the structure of the situation, adjust the home interior space furniture and furnishings, and finally combined with the color plan, and then to achieve a completely harmonious home design status.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
